A mid-line `default:` inside ordinary prose (not the first non-whitespace on
its own physical line) is never mistaken for an arm label — it stays literal
text. Pins the escape-hatch side of the 2026-07-25 line-start fix.
-- input.gsx --
package views

component Note() {
	<div>{ switch 1 {
	default:
		the default: value is 5
	} }</div>
}
-- invoke --
Note()
-- diagnostics.golden --
-- render.golden --
<div>the default: value is 5</div>
-- generated.x.go.golden --
